sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User (PWA)
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant D as Dispatch Service
    participant R as Redis (Geo Index)
    participant N as Notification Gateway
    actor Resp as Nearest Responder
    participant A as Audit Service
    participant PG as PostgreSQL

    U->>GW: POST /v1/sos {geo, type, verified_token}
    GW->>D: Forward SOS (authenticated)
    D->>R: GEOSEARCH nearest verified responders within radius
    R-->>D: Ranked responder list
    D->>N: Push alert to top-N responders (WS + push fallback)
    N-->>Resp: Real-time SOS alert + live location
    Resp->>N: ACK (accept) within SLA window
    N-->>D: Responder accepted
    D-->>U: Live status update ("Help is on the way")
    Note over D,N: If no ACK in 60s, auto-escalate to next-nearest + admin
    Resp->>N: Incident resolved
    N->>A: Log full incident timeline
    A->>PG: Persist immutable audit record
    A-->>U: Resolution confirmation
